  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A PRISMA flow diagram of studies in the review: 170 studies from databases/registers (MEDLINE 130, ClinicalTrials.gov 39, WHO public call for data 1) and 0 from other sources; 15 duplicates removed; 155 screened and 113 excluded; 42 sought and assessed for eligibility, 6 excluded and data not retrievable for 22; 14 studies included (PICO 1: 8, PICO 2: 2, PICO 1 and 2: 4). In this render, some boxes overlap and surrounding page text is drawn over the lower part.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
